**/.git
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/*.md
**/.env*
**/drizzle

# Generated/native build output — not needed to run the three servers.
**/.expo
**/android
**/ios
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# The tileset is mounted into the tile-provider at runtime from
# apps/tile-provider/data (see compose.yaml), not baked into the image.
**/*.mbtiles
**/*.mbtiles-*
**/*.osm.pbf
**/*.pmtiles
**/*.pbf
